{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10364","headline":"送虞城刘明府谒魏郡苗太守 · 高适","name":"送虞城刘明府谒魏郡苗太守","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天官苍生望，出入承明庐。\n肃肃领旧藩，皇皇降玺书。\n茂宰多感激，良将复吹嘘。\n永怀一言合，谁谓千里疎。\n对酒忽命驾，兹情何起予。\n炎天昼如火，极目无行车。\n长路出雷泽，浮云归孟诸。\n魏郡十万家，歌钟喧里闾。\n传道贤君至，闭关常晏如。\n君将挹高论，定是问樵渔。\n今日逢明圣，吾爲陶隐居。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10364.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10364","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}